            "type": "game",
            "name": "Primal Carnage",
            "steam_appid": 215470,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>SEQUEL AVAILABLE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring evolved gameplay mechanics, multiple new dinosaurs, additional game modes, over 30 maps and even Steam Workshop support... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Primal Carnage: Extinction</i></strong> is the successor to the original classic <i>Primal Carnage, </i>with the sequel continuing to receive major content updates to this day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215470/extras/c26d1f5e5dcf798d6952070968c452d3.avif?t=1779576014\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215470/extras_big/c26d1f5e5dcf798d6952070968c452d3.avif?t=1779576014 width=1560 height=894 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRIMAL CARNAGE (Classic)</strong></h2><i>Created By Ashton Anderson</i><br><br>Primal Carnage is an online multiplayer shooter that immerses its players in skilled PVP combat, team-based strategy and savage class-oriented matches unlike any you've previously experienced...<br><br>Dispatched to reclaim a remote island from a dinosaur outbreak, a team of battle-hardened mercenaries fight to take control of its abandoned facilities and secure classified objectives. Play either side in the fight for survival of the fittest, taking on the role of an armed human mercenary or a cunning prehistoric predator. <br><br>It’s Man versus Dinosaur in the ultimate fight for dominance...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>9 Maps with large, open environments illustrating the vastness of an overrun remote island<br></li><li>5 playable dinosaurs, each having unique skills and abilities <br></li><li>5 human classes, with diverse weapons and utilities<br></li><li>Asymmetrical gameplay featuring both first-person (humans) and third-person (dinosaurs) perspectives<br></li><li>&quot;Get to the Chopper&quot; mode - Humans fight through the dino horde to reach their only escape... the CHOPPPER!<br></li><li>Achievements, unlockables, and cosmetic DLC</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRIMAL CARNAGE (Classic)</strong></h2><i>Created By Ashton Anderson</i><br><br>Primal Carnage is an online multiplayer shooter that immerses its players in skilled PVP combat, team-based strategy and savage class-oriented matches unlike any you've previously experienced...<br><br>Dispatched to reclaim a remote island from a dinosaur outbreak, a team of battle-hardened mercenaries fight to take control of its abandoned facilities and secure classified objectives. Play either side in the fight for survival of the fittest, taking on the role of an armed human mercenary or a cunning prehistoric predator. <br><br>It’s Man versus Dinosaur in the ultimate fight for dominance...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>9 Maps with large, open environments illustrating the vastness of an overrun remote island<br></li><li>5 playable dinosaurs, each having unique skills and abilities <br></li><li>5 human classes, with diverse weapons and utilities<br></li><li>Asymmetrical gameplay featuring both first-person (humans) and third-person (dinosaurs) perspectives<br></li><li>&quot;Get to the Chopper&quot; mode - Humans fight through the dino horde to reach their only escape... the CHOPPPER!<br></li><li>Achievements, unlockables, and cosmetic DLC</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "A savage online shooter, where players do battle as man or beast in class-based deathmatches and a frantic escape mode. Unleash your inner dinosaur!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
